ncluded: 1 or 2. Does not turn follow-ups on or off."},"maxReactivationPerDay":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":100,"description":"Daily limit for returning contacts (older contacts being asked again, such as an imported customer list), 0 to 100. Counted apart from new contacts, so a backlog never uses their allowance."},"maxRealtimePerDay":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":50,"description":"Daily limit for new contacts (arriving through new visits or events), 0 to 50. Counted apart from returning contacts."},"resendEnabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether a contact who was already messaged can be asked again. It takes a new visit or event arriving after the resend window; time alone never sends another request. Off: nobody is asked twice."},"resendWindowDays":{"type":"integer","minimum":30,"maximum":365,"description":"Days since the last message before a new visit or event can make a contact eligible again, 30 to 365. Only applies while resend is on, and setting it does not turn resend on."},"sendToReviewedContacts":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether contacts who already left a review can be asked again."},"defaultPhoneRegion":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[A-Za-z]{2}$"},"personalizedImageEnabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether the first request includes a personalized image, when one is available."},"phoneChannelEnabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether review requests go out by text message. Text and email cannot both be off. Turn it off when the business has no phone provider, so the missing provider does not hold back its email requests."},"emailChannelEnabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether review requests go out by email. Text and email cannot both be off. Turn it off when the business has no email provider, so the missing provider does not hold back its text requests."},"messages":{"type":"string","enum":["smart","own"],"description":"Which messages review requests use: smart (the platform's own) or own 