 proposal's business cannot change."},"destination":{"type":"string","enum":["google_place","google_rotation","custom_url"],"description":"Where review requests send people: google_place (one Google place the business uses, given as the place id), google_rotation (rotate evenly between every active place it uses; needs two or more, and each person always lands on the same one), or custom_url (a web address you give)."},"placeId":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$","description":"The Google place to send everyone to, with the google_place destination: one of the active places the destination read lists for this business. Only with google_place."},"customUrl":{"type":"string","allOf":[{"description":"The web address to send everyone to, with the custom_url destination: http or https, such as a Yelp or Facebook page or the business's own site. Only with custom_url."}]},"flow":{"type":"string","enum":["direct","feedback"],"description":"What a tap does first: direct (straight to the destination) or feedback (ask how it went; the highest ratings go on to the destination, anything lower opens a private comment box instead of a public review)."},"handoffMinRating":{"type":"number","enum":[4,5],"description":"With the feedback flow, the lowest rating that goes on to the destination: 5 (only five stars) or 4 (four and five stars). Anything lower opens the private comment box. With the direct flow it is kept and has no effect until the flow is feedback again."}},"required":["businessId"],"additionalProperties":false},"id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|[fF]{8}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{12})$","format":"uuid"},"groupId":{"type":"string","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|[fF]{8}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{12})$","format":"uuid"},"selecti