reviews publish to Google without a person approving each one; off, each waits as a draft for a person. Every star rating has its own switch, and this one changes no other."},"linkLikelyMatches":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether a likely match between a review and a contact is linked automatically; off, it waits as a suggestion to confirm. Sets it for this business, over what it inherits from its organization or the account."}},"required":["businessId"],"additionalProperties":false},"id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|[fF]{8}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{12})$","format":"uuid"},"groupId":{"type":"string","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|[fF]{8}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{12})$","format":"uuid"},"selection":{"type":"string","enum":["included","withdrawn","rejected"]}},"required":["mutationType","schemaVersion","input","id","groupId","selection"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"mutationType":{"type":"string","enum":["business_review_voice"]},"schemaVersion":{"type":"number","enum":[1]},"input":{"type":"object","properties":{"businessId":{"type":"string","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|[fF]{8}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{12})$","format":"uuid","description":"Business whose voice to change, in the authenticated account, as businesses list returns it. A saved proposal's business cannot change."},"reviewId":{"type":"string","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|[fF]{8}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{4}-[fF]{12})$","format":"uuid","description":"Review whose reply to add or take out, as the business's reviews lis