ee the Email template gallery and the selected template, effective colors and business footer. Sequences provide the words; the template provides the look. Options include their default colors and HTML; the selection includes inherited color overrides. Placeholders remain unfilled.","summary":"Read email template options and selection"}},"/v1/businesses/{businessId}/reputation/automation":{"get":{"tags":["Reviews and private feedback"],"operationId":"businessReputationReviews.getAutomation","parameters":[{"name":"businessId","in":"path","schema":{"type":"string"},"required":true}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"object":{"type":"string","enum":["review_automation"]},"businessId":{"type":"string"},"businessName":{"type":"string","description":"The business's name. Not unique: act on businessId."},"publishFiveStarReplies":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether replies to five-star reviews publish to Google without a person approving them; off, each waits as a draft. The business's own setting: never inherited."},"publishFourStarReplies":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether replies to four-star reviews publish to Google without a person approving them; off, each waits as a draft. The business's own setting: never inherited."},"publishThreeStarReplies":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether replies to three-star reviews publish to Google without a person approving them; off, each waits as a draft. The business's own setting: never inherited."},"publishTwoStarReplies":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether replies to two-star reviews publish to Google without a person approving them; off, each waits as a draft. The business's own setting: never inherited."},"publishOneStarReplies":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether replies to one-star reviews publish to Google without a person approving them; off, each waits as a draft. The business's own setting: never inherited."},"linkLikelyMatches":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether a likely match between a review and a contact is linked automatically; when off, it waits as a suggestion to confirm. A review from someone with exactly a contact's name is linked either way."},"origins":{"type":"object","properties":{"publishReplies":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","enum":["business","organization","account","default"]},{"type":"string"}],"description":"business: set for this business; organization or account: inherited from there; default: nobody has set it."},"linkLikelyMatches":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","enum":["business","organization","account","default"]},{"type":"string"}],"description":"business: set for this business; organization or account: inherited from there; default: nobody has set it."}},"required":["publishReplies","linkLikelyMatches"],"additionalProperties":false},"voice":{"type":"object","properties":{"limit":{"type":"integer"},"examples":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"object":{"type":"string","enum":["review_voice_example"]},"reviewId":{"type":"string"},"rating":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}]},"reviewText":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"replyText":{"type":"string"},"addedAt":{"type":"string","description":"ISO-8601 UTC timestamp."}},"required":["object","reviewId","rating","reviewText","replyText","addedAt"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["limit","examples"],"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["object","businessId","businessName","publishFiveStarReplies","publishFourStarReplies","publishThreeStarReplies","publishTwoStarReplies","publishOneStarReplies","linkLikelyMatches","origins","voice"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"401":{"description":"The bearer credential is missing or not usable.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UnauthorizedEncoded"}}}},"403":{"description":"The credential is not permitted to perform this operation.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ForbiddenEncoded"}}}},"404":{"description":"The requested tenant does not exist.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/NotFoundEncoded"}}}}},"description":"What happens on its own when this business gets a Google review: for each star rating, whether replies to reviews of that rating publish without a person approving them (`publishOneStarReplies` to `publishFiveStarReplies`, one switch per rating, the business's own setting, never inherited), whether a likely contact is linked automatically (`linkLikelyMatches`, inherited unless the business sets its own), where each value comes from (`origins`), and the voice examples its replies are drafted after, in full. The same fields a `business_review_automation` proposal takes; a `business_review_voice` proposal adds or removes an example.","summary":"Read the review automation"}},"/v1/businesses/{businessId}/reputation/destination":{"get":{"tags":["Reviews and private feedback"],"operationId":"businessReputationReviews.getDestination","parameters":[{"name":"businessId","in":"path","schema":{"type":"string"},"required":true}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"object":{"type":"string","enum":["review_request_destination"]},"businessId":{"type":"string"},"businessName":{"type":"string","description":"The business's name. Not unique: act on businessId."},"destination":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","enum":["google_place","google_rotation","custom_url"]},{"type":"string"}]},"placeId":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"customUrl":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"flow":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","enum":["direct","feedback"]},{"type":"string"}]},"handoffMinRating":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number","enum":[4,5]},{"type":"integer"}]},"inEffect":{"type":"object","properties":{"destination":{"anyOf":[{"type":"strin