en its active Google places, or a web address, with `placeId` or `customUrl`), what a tap does first (`flow`), the lowest rating its feedback page sends on to the destination (`handoffMinRating`: 5, or 4 for four and five stars; kept and not in effect while the flow is `direct`), where a tap lands right now, the Google places the business uses with their status, what can be chosen now, and what is wrong. The same five fields a `business_review_request_destination` proposal takes. The destination is the business's own; nothing inherits it.","summary":"Read the review request destination"}},"/v1/businesses/{businessId}/reputation/reviews":{"get":{"tags":["Reviews and private feedback"],"operationId":"businessReputationReviews.listReviews","parameters":[{"name":"businessId","in":"path","schema":{"type":"string"},"required":true},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[+-]?\\d*\\.?\\d+(?:[Ee][+-]?\\d+)?$"},"required":false},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","description":"Opaque nextCursor from this business and endpoint. Omit for the first page."},"required":false},{"name":"rating","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[+-]?\\d*\\.?\\d+(?:[Ee][+-]?\\d+)?$"},"required":false},{"name":"replied","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["true","false"]},"required":false}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"businessId":{"type":"string"},"businessName":{"type":"string","description":"The business's name. Not unique: act on businessId."},"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"object":{"type":"string","enum":["reputation_review"]},"id":{"type":"string"},"placeId":{"type":"string"},"rating":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}]},"text":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"reviewer":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"nul