l that answered is never listed by itself. Every site of the account unless `site` names one; `function` and `caller` narrow further. A site or a function that is not the account's is 404.","summary":"Function call overview"}},"/v1/account/site-functions/failures":{"get":{"tags":["Function call history"],"operationId":"accountSiteFunctions.functionFailures","parameters":[{"name":"site","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Only this site's calls, by the site's id. Left out: every site of the account."},"required":false},{"name":"function","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9]{1,64}$","description":"Only this function's calls, by the function's id."},"required":false},{"name":"days","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[+-]?\\d*\\.?\\d+(?:[Ee][+-]?\\d+)?$"},"required":false},{"name":"caller","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["site","author"],"description":"Only calls made for one caller: site (a deployed site calling its function) or author (someone trying it with invoke). Left out: both."},"required":false},{"name":"stage","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["environment","code","runtime","timeout","answer","handler","output","platform"],"description":"Only failures that stopped at this stage: handler (its code threw), output (it answered something its output schema refuses), runtime (it crashed, ran out of CPU time or hung), timeout, answer, code (its upload is not in storage), environment (a secret could not be opened) or platform (Heysegment's own fault)."},"required":false},{"name":"invocation","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^inv_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","description":"Only this one failed call, by its invocation id (inv_…): shown whole, with its full stack."},"required":false},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[+-]?\\d*\\.?\\d+(?:[Ee][+-]?\\d+)?$"},"required":false},{"name":"cursor